# Third-party runtimes — fetched locally per vendor/README.md.
# Pixi + pixi-live2d-display are MIT so they could be checked in, but Live2D
# Cubism Core is proprietary and must not be. Keep the whole folder out of
# git to avoid mixing licensed and un-licensed blobs.
vendor/*.js

# Live2D models (artist IP). Users supply their own.
assets/live2d/*/
!assets/live2d/README.md
